                                                "sense_id": "51cd4ce2-627b-31ab-b7cc-43501c81d96d",
                                                "text": "Rape and clover has yielded 283 sheep days of pasture, practically dry weather […] For the coming year it is planned to goat this area continuously"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cf7e62a-ffb2-39ca-8dab-9f47324dbff7",
                                        "entry_id": "63ca36c6-b717-37fe-b3b3-28fb54d34548",
