                                                "sense_id": "0bde8f7e-cb6d-34ec-a279-2a98e10c851b",
                                                "text": "[…] For the Sands from the Mouth of the Sluices and Goats would be carried off and the Haven so deep that their Commons and Low Fens will be will be drain'd in wet Seasons, and always be Supplied with fresh water above the Lock for the use and benefit of the Commons."
